Sean Quah created KAFKA-20273:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Trigger rebalance on downgrade to classic group with outdated assignment
                 Key: KAFKA-20273
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20273
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: group-coordinator
            Reporter: Sean Quah
            Assignee: Sean Quah
             Fix For: 4.3.0


When assignment batching or offload are enabled, the target assignment can lag behind group subscriptions. When downgrading to a classic group, we must trigger a rebalance if the assignment is out of date.



--
