Hi everyone,
I'm looking for a review on PR #21606, which adds documentation for
implementing custom exception handlers with Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) support
in Kafka Streams, as introduced by KIP-1034.

PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21606
JIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19863

The PR is a documentation update (approx. 50 lines) and is currently
passing all automated checks. I've tagged a few reviewers on GitHub, but
wanted to bring it to the list's attention as well.
Thanks for your time!

Best regards,
Rajarshi Misra

