Hi,
I would like to begin the voting on a small KIP which enhances the Kafka pr=
otocol so client connections indicate the cluster ID and node ID they are a=
ttempting to connect to. This prevents situations in which clients connect =
to the wrong node and begin using it regardless, as has been observed from =
time to time, typically due to a configuration problem or a faulty intermed=
iary between the client and broker.

KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1242%3A+Detectio=
n+and+handling+of+misrouted+connections

Discussion thread: https://lists.apache.org/thread/6gntsvp5kmm74pp2svqk8ob0=
ozwxsh3x

Thanks,
Andrew

