    Fix Version/s: 4.3.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Enhance docs and test coverage for `producer-props` and `command-property`
> --------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-20281
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20281
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
>            Assignee: PoAn Yang
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.3.0
>
>
> The correct usage is "--producer-props acks=-1 linger.ms=5000", but I've noticed users trying various other formats, such as " --producer-props acks=-1,linger.ms=5000" or " --producer-props acks=-1 --producer-props linger.ms=5000"Therefore, it would be helpful to enhance the documentation and test coverage to clarify this. 
> The documentation updates should cover both the markdown file and the tool's help text



