Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi, we would like to start a discussion thread about KIP-1295:Dead letter
queue support for global store/KTable.

It's a follow-up of KIP-1270. We do not support records which failed during
global store/KTable processing to be available in DLQ. It currently logs
record metadata. With this  KIP, we aim to enable the DLQ support, which
would enable the end user to have more control over the failed record.


Thanks and Regards
Arpit Goyal
