-----------------------------------------

             Summary: Cleanup `use_share_groups` in system tests
                 Key: KAFKA-20299
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20299
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Sanskar Jhajharia


Ref: [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21708#discussion_r2923354984]

