Hi Chia-Ping,

Thanks for pointing me to the KIP process.

My understanding is that the issue here is that controller-only nodes
expose a metric tag named BrokerId, which is misleading for that role.
Since this affects exported metrics, I agree this likely needs a KIP
discussion.

Also, this JIRA is currently assigned to me, so I started exploring a
possible fix in the PR. I=E2=80=99m happy to draft a KIP and start the disc=
ussion
if that=E2=80=99s the preferred path.

Thanks,

Nilesh

