>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>          Components: connect
>            Reporter: Mario Fiore Vitale
>            Assignee: Mario Fiore Vitale
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.3.0
>
>
> This improvement, related to [KIP-1273|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluenc=
e/display/KAFKA/KIP-1273%3A+Improve+Connect+configurable+components+discove=
rability],=C2=A0 introduces a common {{ConfigSpecifier}} interface for Kafk=
a Connect components that expose configuration metadata. By unifying the ex=
isting {{config()}} method across connectors, converters, transformations, =
and predicates under a single contract, it simplifies component discovery, =
reduces code duplication, and enables uniform tooling for configuration int=
rospection, validation, documentation, and UI generation. The change is ful=
ly backward compatible and requires no modifications to existing component =
implementations.



