Hi everyone,

I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1292 that introduces a new
MirrorMaker2 Connector for syncing consumer group offsets using timestamps
instead of internal topics.
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1292%3A+New+MirrorMaker2+Connector+for+syncing+consumer+offsets

Any feedback and suggestions for the KIP are welcome in this email thread.

Thank you.
Regards,
Gantigmaa Selenge

