Alieh Saeedi created KAFKA-20308:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Update TopologyTestDriver  to support for headers-awa=
re stores
                 Key: KAFKA-20308
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20308
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Alieh Saeedi


Problem

TopologyTestDriver cannot access or test headers-aware state stores (Timest=
ampedKeyValueStoreWithHeaders and TimestampedWindowStoreWithHeaders). When =
users add these stores to their topology
=C2=A0 and try to access them in tests using existing methods like getKeyVa=
lueStore() or getTimestampedKeyValueStore(), they encounter issues:

=C2=A0 1. No method to retrieve the raw headers-aware store (with headers a=
ccess)
=C2=A0 2. Existing getter methods don't recognize headers-aware stores
=C2=A0 3. Tests cannot write test data or assert on values from headers-awa=
re stores
=C2=A0 4. No way to verify header-related functionality in tests



