             Summary: Cleanup "leaking" internal interface `WindowedSeriali=
zer`
                 Key: KAFKA-20313
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20313
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


Kafka Streams has an internal helper interface `WindowedSerializer`, which =
the two public classes `TimeWindowedSerializer` and `SessionWindowedSeriali=
zer` implement.

This leaks the internal method `serializeBaseKey` into public API. We shoul=
d try to clean this up.

