Hi Yeojun,

Welcome to the Kafka community! As Kafka is a very popular open-source
project (OSS) with many active contributors, "Good First Issues" are often
occupied quickly.

I've gone ahead and created KAFKA-20316
<https://www.google.com/url?source=3Dgmail&sa=3DE&q=3Dhttps://issues.apache=
.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20316>
for you, which involves migrating a test. If you are interested in taking
this on, please feel free to raise any questions you may have.

Best regards,

Chia-Ping

