Hello all,

I've updated KIP-1256 to include a new mechanism for broker static =
config reporting.=20
The core idea is that brokers will send their relevant static =
configurations to the controller=20
during registration via BrokerRegistrationRequest. This is necessary =
because some=20
dynamic config validations on the broker side depend on static config =
context =E2=80=94 without=20
this information, the controller cannot fully replicate the broker's =
validation logic. With this=20
change, the controller can perform the same context-aware validation as =
brokers,=20
completing the alignment addressed in this KIP.=20

Any feedback would be appreciated.

Best Regards,
Jiunn-Yang

