On 2026/03/16 14:41:54 Ming-Yen Chung wrote:
> Hi all,
>=20
> I would like to start a discussion on
> KIP-1296: Shadow Jetty dependencies to decouple from SLF4J version conflict
> <https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/c5I8G>
>=20
> Kafka is pinned to Jetty 12.0.25 because Jetty 12.0.30+ uses SLF4J 2.x
> fluent API calls that cause NoSuchMethodError with Kafka's SLF4J 1.7.x.
> This blocks two CVE fixes (KAFKA-20270, KAFKA-20283).
>=20
> This KIP proposes a shadow JAR module that bundles Jetty with a relocated
> slf4j-api 2.x, allowing Jetty to use SLF4J 2.x internally without
> affecting Kafka's SLF4J 1.x. No public interfaces are changed.
>=20
> Example PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21773
>=20
> Thanks,
> Ming-Yen
>=20

