Hi Mickael,

Thanks again for volunteering for the 4.3 release. I just merged (1)
Jonah's implementation for KIP-1219 (2). KAFKA-19541 (3) is marked for
a fix in 4.3.0. Users have experienced controller unavailability when
deployed on low-bandwidth networks. This KIP and its implementation
make the fix configurable.

Can I cherry-pick the commit to the 4.3 branch?

(1) https://github.com/apache/kafka/commit/4d3c65898dff8bf03a1111cb9956c634=
0e29de81
(2) https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1219%3A+Configura=
tions+for+KRaft+Fetch+and+FetchSnapshot+Byte+Size
(3) https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19541

Thanks,
--=20
-Jos=C3=A9

