Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-20362:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Rescue the Tired Reviewer: Auto-fill PR Reviewers
                 Key: KAFKA-20362
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20362
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


We already have the great `committer-tools/reviewers.py` to generate the list. However, as a "highly efficient" (read: lazy) reviewer, I'm getting tired of manually typing these names every time.

It would be a dream come true to have a tool that auto-fills the "possible" reviewers into the PR description. That why, I can spend my limited energy on reviewing the code, and just give the reviewer list a quick review before merging.



--
