Hi Mickael,

Thanks for the response.
I agree that there is no critical reason to push KIP-909 into 4.3.
Since I've been dealing with some last-minute issues, I'd rather not rush
this. Although they've been addressed, the changes deserve a thorough
review to ensure we don't introduce any new regressions.
Moving it to 4.4 makes sense.

Best,
TengYao Chi

