> targeting 12.0.34)
> - Jetty 12.1.x: https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/pull/14748 (merged,=

> targeting 12.1.8)
>=20
> The Jetty maintainer also indicated that Jetty 13.0.x will likely stay on
> non-fluent APIs as well (https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/issues/147=
47
> ).
