> >> > > >> > > > > > > preserving the existing topic for audit history; th=
is
> >> > allows
> >> > > >> > > brokers
> >> > > >> > > > to
> >> > > >> > > > > > > build their metadata cache exclusively from the
> >> compacted
> >> > > >> topic,
