Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-20371:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Add Iterable constructor to generated message collections
                 Key: KAFKA-20371
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20371
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
