Hello everyone,=20

I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1299 Use key range in =
ProducerPerformance
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/XpQ8G>

This proposal aims to add configurable key distribution support to =
kafka-producer-perf-test.=20
Currently, the tool always produces records with null keys, which does =
not reflect real-world=20
keyed workloads. This KIP introduces two new arguments =E2=80=94 =
--key-distribution and --message-key-range=20
=E2=80=94 enabling engineers to benchmark with round-robin or random key =
strategies over a bounded=20
key space, providing more realistic performance measurements.

Best regards,
Jiunn-Yang=

