          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Aditya Kousik


=C2=A0ConsumerInterceptor operates at batch level. There is no client-level=
 hook for per-record processing lifecycle (span creation, MDC, context prop=
agation). Frameworks and instrumentation libraries have
=C2=A0 =C2=A0independently built workarounds. This KIP adds ConsumerRecordC=
ontextProcessor to fill that gap. See KIP-1305.



