Aditya Kousik created KAFKA-20386:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: SerDe and Interceptor Metrics
                 Key: KAFKA-20386
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20386
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: clients, consumer, producer 
            Reporter: Aditya Kousik


Serialization, deserialization, and interceptor execution have no client-side metrics. Serde regressions and slow interceptors are invisible without ad-hoc instrumentation. Publishing these metrics allows users some signal before diving into broker/client connections.



