Aditya Kousik created KAFKA-20387:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types
                 Key: KAFKA-20387
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20387
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: clients
            Reporter: Aditya Kousik


RecordHeader values are raw byte[], requiring manual ByteBuffer conversion at every read and write site. We should consider adding static factories (ofString, ofInt..) and typed accessors (stringValue(), intValue() ...) for the common types used in headers. See [KIP-1308|http://example.com]



